# Normalize everything to LF in the repository and on checkout, so the
# package is identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Legal texts are exempt from ALL conversion. They are reproduced under their
# upstream terms and NOTICES.md asserts their exact byte counts, so a line
# ending rewrite on checkout would falsify that claim. It matters most for
# LICENSE-upstream-defending-code-reference-harness.txt, which is a MODIFIED
# Apache 2.0 and must stay distinguishable from the canonical text beside it.
LICENSE          -text
LICENSE-*.txt    -text
